// Analytics domain seed — realistic demo values for the ship-analytics-* component pack.
// World: 'harbor' project on feat/checkout-flow, agents rust-lane + code-reviewer.
// Generator strips full-line // comments and emits proto/fixtures/demo/analytics.json.
// Field names follow AnalyticsSession / AnalyticsToolUsage / AnalyticsTurn in analytics.proto.
{
  "_meta": {
    "domain": "analytics",
    "description": "AnalyticsService demo — ListSessions (9 sessions: multiple actors, harnesses claude-code/cursor/null, models sonnet/opus/haiku/null; mix of completed + open; errors present), GetSession detail for sess-rust-lane-4, SessionTurns (5 turns varying reasoning + cache; one turn cost absent), ToolUsage all-time (8 tools incl. one with errors + one with avg_duration_ms absent), ToolUsage since-filtered (3 tools), empty states, retryable + argument error states."
  },

